  "code": "const int LED = 23;   // chân GPIO LED trên bàn lắp mạch\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(LED, OUTPUT);\n  Serial.begin(115200);\n  Serial.println(\"Bat dau nhay LED\");\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  digitalWrite(LED, HIGH);\n  Serial.println(\"LED: BAT\");\n  delay(500);\n  digitalWrite(LED, LOW);\n  Serial.println(\"LED: TAT\");\n  delay(500);\n}\n",
